se\"> \r\n                                    <tr> \r\n                                        <th style=\"color:#707070;font:normal 14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;padding:2px 0\">\r\n                                            Issue Type:\r\n                                        </th> \r\n                                        <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;font:normal 14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;padding:2px 0 2px 5px;vertical-align:top\"> <img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/sparkr-dev/attach/aa50caaf70f6b1ae/?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" border=\"0\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"Improvement\" style=\"vertical-align:text-bottom\"> Improvement \r\n                                        </td> \r\n                                    </tr> \r\n                                    <tr> \r\n                                        <th style=\"color:#707070;font:normal 14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;padding:2px 0\">\r\n                                            Assignee:\r\n                                        </th> \r\n                                        <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;font:normal 14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;padding:2px 0 2px 5px;vertical-align:top\"> <a rel=\"sunrui nofollow\" href=\"https://sparkr.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=sunrui\" style=\"color:#3b73af;color:#3b73af;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sparkr.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name%3Dsunrui&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241033034000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2negKhpe0m4KzWDPbSwqeH\">Sun Rui</a> \r\n                                        </td> \r\n                                    </tr> \r\n                                    <tr> \r\n                                        <th style=\"color:#707070;font:normal 14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;padding:2px 0\">\r\n                                            Components:\r\n                                        </th> \r\n                                        <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;font:normal 14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;padding:2px 0 2px 5px;vertical-align:top\">\r\n                                             Internals \r\n                                        </td> \r\n                                    </tr> \r\n                                    <tr> \r\n                                        <th style=\"color:#707070;font:normal 14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;padding:2px 0\">\r\n                                            Created:\r\n                                        </th> \r\n                                        <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;font:normal 14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;padding:2px 0 2px 5px;vertical-align:top\">\r\n                                             11/Oct/14 1:00 AM \r\n                                        </td> \r\n                                    </tr> \r\n                                    <tr> \r\n                                        <th style=\"color:#707070;font:normal 14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;padding:2px 0\">\r\n                                            Priority:\r\n                                        </th> \r\n                                        <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;font:normal 14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;padding:2px 0 2px 5px;vertical-align:top\"> <img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/sparkr-dev/attach/aa50caaf70f6b1ae/?part=0.4&amp;view=1\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" border=\"0\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"Major\" style=\"vertical-align:text-bottom\"> Major \r\n                                        </td> \r\n                                    </tr> \r\n                                    <tr> \r\n                                        <th style=\"color:#707070;font:normal 14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;padding:2px 0\">\r\n                                            Reporter:\r\n                                        </th> \r\n                                        <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;font:normal 14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;padding:2px 0 2px 5px;vertical-align:top\"> <a rel=\"sunrui nofollow\" href=\"https://sparkr.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=sunrui\" style=\"color:#3b73af;color:#3b73af;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sparkr.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name%3Dsunrui&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241033034000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2negKhpe0m4KzWDPbSwqeH\">Sun Rui</a> \r\n                                        </td> \r\n                                    </tr> \r\n                                </table> \r\n                            </td> \r\n                        </tr> \r\n                        <tr> \r\n                            <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;border-left:1px solid #ccc;border-right:1px solid #ccc;border-top:0;border-bottom:0;padding:0 15px 0 16px;background-color:#fff;padding-top:5px;padding-bottom:10px\"> \r\n                                <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px\"> \r\n                                    <tr> \r\n                                        <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;padding:0 0 10px 0\"> \r\n                                            <p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:10px;margin:10px 0 0 0\">Currently, in compute() of RRDD/PairwiseRRDD, iterator() of the parent RDD is called after a R worker process is launched. This causes larger memory consumption because current RDD&#39;s R worker process will wait for parent RDD&#39;s computation and can do nothing before parent RDD&#39;s computation returns. If the parent RDD is an RRDD, then both R worker process of current and parent RRDD co-exist, which makes no sense.</p> \r\n                                            <p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:10px;margin:10px 0 0 0\">Optimization can be done by getting the iterator of the parent RDD before launching a R worker process.</p> \r\n                                        </td> \r\n                                    </tr> \r\n                                </table> \r\n                            </td> \r\n                        </tr> \r\n                        <tr> \r\n                            <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;border-left:1px solid #ccc;border-right:1px solid #ccc;border-top:0;border-bottom:0;padding:0 15px 0 16px;background-color:#fff\"> \r\n                                <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px\"> \r\n                                    <tr> \r\n                                        <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;padding:10px 0 10px 24px;vertical-align:middle;padding-left:0\"> \r\n                                            <table align=\"left\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"> \r\n                                                <tr> \r\n                                                    <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:middle\"> <a href=\"https://sparkr.atlassian.net/browse/SPARKR-125#add-comment\" title=\"Add Comment\" style=\"color:#3b73af;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sparkr.atlassian.net/browse/SPARKR-125%23add-comment&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241033034000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1cSF1KAvnJwN9ZkLnm4JbM\"> <img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/sparkr-dev/attach/aa50caaf70f6b1ae/?part=0.2&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Add Comment\" title=\"Add Comment\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" border=\"0\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"> </a> \r\n                                                    </td> \r\n                                                    <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;padding-left:5px\"> <a href=\"https://sparkr.atlassian.net/browse/SPARKR-125#add-comment\" title=\"Add Comment\" style=\"color:#3b73af;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sparkr.atlassian.net/browse/SPARKR-125%23add-comment&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241033035000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ohkZxvnUSomfoxp0xG7oI\">Add Comment</a> \r\n                                                    </td> \r\n                                                </tr> \r\n                                            </table> \r\n                                        </td> \r\n                                    </tr> \r\n                                </table> \r\n                            </td> \r\n                        </tr> \r\n                         \r\n                        <tr> \r\n                            <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;color:#fff;padding:0 15px 0 16px;height:5px;line-height:5px;background-color:#fff;border-top:0;border-left:1px solid #ccc;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;border-right:1px solid #ccc;border-bottom-right-radius:5px;border-bottom-left-radius:5px\">\r\n                                 \r\n                            </td> \r\n                        </tr> \r\n                    </table> \r\n                </td> \r\n            </tr> \r\n            <tr> \r\n                <td style=\"padding:0px;border-collapse:collapse;padding:12px 20px\"> \r\n                    <